  m_text: 'LO3.2 / LO3.3 - Prove the restrictions hold, then document the job.


    Open
    Event Viewer > Windows Logs > Security and check for Audit Failure entries from
    accounts that should not have access.


    Record the server name, IP configuration,
    roles installed, accounts and groups created, share and printer permissions,
    and all test results in the service report, then have it signed by your supervisor.


    Tap
    NEXT to see your final score.'
